.claude
.mcp.json

# Beads / Dolt files (added by bd init)
.dolt/
*.db
.beads-credential-key
.beads/proxieddb/

# Build output. `go build ./...` drops the binary next to the sources; the
# shipped artifact is built and signed by CI, never committed. The name is
# identity.sh's BINARY_NAME — the only build output this repo produces.
/browser-print-agentd

# lat.md local index. The markdown under lat.md/ is the source of truth; the
# embedding cache is rebuilt on demand and is per-machine.
lat.md/.cache/

# Installer staging output. `packaging/build-pkg.sh --stage-only` writes here on
# every run; the shipped .pkg is built and signed by CI, never committed.
packaging/dist/
